.TH start-cli-server-bittorrent-set-address-enabled 1  "set-address-enabled "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-server\-bittorrent\-set\-address\-enabled \- Set a gateway address enabled for a binding
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli server bittorrent set\-address\-enabled\fR <\fB\-\-address\fR> <\fB\-\-enabled\fR> [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set a gateway address enabled for a binding
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-address\fR \fI<ADDRESS>\fR
Address details as a JSON HostnameInfo object
.TP
\fB\-\-enabled\fR \fI<ENABLED>\fR
Enable or disable this binding
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
true
.IP \(bu 2
false
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR

.TP
